{"Swap jewels, chase cascades, finish the goals.":"交換珠寶，追逐瀑布，完成目標。","Choose a mode":"選擇模式","Mode select":"模式選擇","Play":"開始遊戲","Learn":"學習","Journey":"旅程","Daily":"每日","Practice":"練習","Challenge":"挑戰","Score chase":"分數追逐","Daily challenge":"每日挑戰","Short hands-on lessons — one rule at a time.":"簡短嘅實踐課程 — 一次一個規則。","40 authored stages with growing mechanics.":"40 個手工關卡，機制不斷增加。","One shared seed per UTC day. Same board for everyone.":"每個 UTC 日一個共享種子。同一個板畀所有人。","Your difficulty, your seed, undo allowed. Unrated.":"你嘅難度，你嘅種子，可以復原。未評分。","Tight move limits, timers and altered layouts.":"緊縮移動限制、計時器同埋改變咗嘅版面配置。","Chase the board on a validated shareable seed.":"喺可分享經驗證種子上追逐棋盤。","Help":"幫助","How to play":"玩法說明","Settings":"設定","Profile":"個人檔案","Profile & privacy":"個人檔案同私隱","Achievements":"成就","Achievements unlocked":"已解鎖成就","Leaderboards":"排行榜","Boards":"棋盤","Global":"全球","Friends":"朋友","Back":"返回","Close":"關閉","Start":"開始","Skip":"跳過","Text board":"文字板","Click a jewel, then an adjacent jewel, to swap. Keyboard: arrows move the cursor, Enter selects.":"點擊一顆寶石，然後點擊相鄰嘅寶石嚟交換。鍵盤：方向鍵移動游標，Enter 選擇。","Guest":"訪客","guest":"訪客","Player":"玩家","Stage {n} of {total} · {stars}★":"{total} · {stars} 嘅階段 {n} ★","{name} · mastery {level}":"{name} · 掌握 {level}","Best {score}":"最佳 {score}","new board in {time}":"{time} 入面嘅新板","cloud: offline":"雲：離線","cloud: saving…":"雲端：儲存緊…","cloud: synced":"雲端：已同步","Cloud save applied.":"雲端存檔已應用。","Resume round?":"恢復輪？","You have an interrupted round:":"你有一輪中斷咗：","{name} — score {score}, {moves} moves left.":"{name} — 得分 {score} ， {moves} 向左移動。","Resume":"繼續","Discard":"捨棄","Round":"回合","Setup — {mode}":"設定 — {mode}","Rules":"規則","Goals":"目標","Expected duration":"預計時間","Players":"玩家","Assists":"輔助功能","Ranked?":"排名？","Ranked":"排名","Ranked (personal bests)":"排名（個人最佳）","Ranked (recorded locally)":"排名（本地有記錄）","Casual":"悠閒","{w}×{h} · {colors} colors · {moves} moves":"{w} × {h} · {colors} 顏色 · {moves} 移動","unlimited":"無限","{n} ice":"{n} 冰","{n} crates":"{n} 箱子","{tim