l swaps.":"{n} 合法換股。","The round is over.":"回合結束。","That cell is outside the board.":"該格喺棋盤範圍外。","Jewels must be neighbours to swap.":"珠寶一定係鄰居先可以換。","There is no jewel there.":"嗰度冇珠寶。","Crates cannot be moved — match beside them.":"木箱郁得郁唔郁 — 喺佢隔離做連線。","That jewel is frozen in ice. Match through it to crack it.":"嗰隻寶石係冰凍咗。穿過佢去破解佢。","That swap makes no line of three.":"嗰個交換令到冇三行。","That move was not understood.":"嗰個動作係唔明白嘅。","Already done.":"已經完成。","Nothing to undo.":"沒有可復原的步驟。","Hold on — the board is settling.":"等下 — 板正喺度沉降。","The lesson is guiding a different move.":"呢堂課係指引緊一個唔同嘅動作。","That move is not legal.":"該步唔合法。","Hint: watch the two highlighted jewels.":"提示：睇住兩隻突顯嘅珠寶。","Hint shown on the board.":"板上顯示嘅提示。","Undone.":"已復原。","Camera: {preset}":"鏡頭：{preset}","default":"預設","low":"低","high":"高","Step {n} of {total}":"第 {n} 步，共 {total} 步","Lesson step {n} of {total}.":"{total} 嘅課程步驟 {n} 。","End lesson":"結束課","Lesson complete!":"課程完成！","Results":"結果","Commission complete!":"委託完成！","Out of moves":"步數用盡","Round resigned":"本局已放棄","Time expired":"時間已過","Round over":"回合結束","{n} stars.":"{n} 星。","Score breakdown":"分數明細","Component":"組件","Points":"分數","Total":"總計","Matches":"比賽","Cascade bonuses":"瀑布獎勵","Specials":"特價","Blockers cleared":"障礙已清除","Goal bonuses":"入球獎金","Unused-move bonus":"未用過嘅招式加成","No points scored":"冇得分","Mastery":"精通","+{xp} XP · level {level}":"+{xp} XP · 等級 {level}","level up!":"升一級！","{n} XP to next":"{n} XP 到下一個","Unlocked {type}: {name}":"解鎖嘅 {type} ： {name}","theme":"主題","trail":"小徑","frame":"架","title":"標題","Daily streak {n} 🔥":"每日連勝 {n} 🔥","New personal best on this board!":"呢個板有新嘅個人最佳成績！","Personal best on this board: {score}.":"呢個板上面個人最好嘅： {score} 。","Next stage":"下一關","Next lesson":"下一課","Play again":"再玩一次","Retry":"重試","Replay":"重新開始","Replay unavailable for this round.":"呢個回合唔可以重播。","Replay of your round — {n} moves.":"你嘅回合嘅重播 — {n} 移動。","Replay complete — final score {score}.":"重播完成 — 最終比分 {score} 。","End replay":"結束重播","Audio":"音效","Muted":"已靜音","Sound on":"開啟音效","Captions for audio cues":"音效提示字幕","Display & accessibility":"顯示同無障礙","Color palette":"色盤","Default":"預設","Deuteranopia-safe":"綠色色弱安全","Protanopia-safe":"紅色色盲適用","Tritanopia-safe":"藍色色弱安全","High contrast":"高對比","Left-handed layout":"左手佈局","Hold to drag jewels":"按住就可以拖住珠寶","Timing assistance":"計時輔助","Camera":"鏡頭","Low (near tabletop)":"低（近枱面）","High (top-down)":"高（自上而下）","Controls":"控制","Actions":"操作","Camera preset":"鏡頭預設","Display name":"顯示名稱","Replay tutorials (reset progress)":"重播教學（重設進度）","Tutorials reset — they will play again from Learn.":"教學課程重設 — 佢哋會喺學習入面再次玩。","Danger zone":"危險地帶","Reset all data":"重設所有數據","Reset all data?":"重設所有數據？","Erase every local setting, progress record and snapshot for this game.":"清除呢個遊戲嘅所有本地設定、進度記錄同快照。","This erases every local setting, progress record, and snapshot for Jewel Cascade on this device. This cannot be undone.":"呢個操作會清除呢部裝置上面嘅 Jewel Cascade 嘅所有本地設定、進度記錄同快照。呢個係復原唔到嘅。","Erase everything":"清除全部資料","Cancel":"取消","Cosmetics":"外觀","Cosmetics change looks only — never rules, timing, or information.":"外觀只會改變外觀 — 絕對唔會改變規則、時機或資訊。","Theme":"主題","Trail":"小徑","Frame":"框架","Title":"標題","(locked)":"（已鎖定）","Career":"生涯","Rounds completed":"已完成回合數","Rounds won":"獲勝回合數","Current win streak":"目前連勝","Best win streak":"最佳連勝紀錄","Total score":"總分","Daily streak":"每日連勝","Level {level} · {xp} XP":"等級 {level} · {xp} XP","{n} to next":"{n} 到下一個","max level":"最高水平","{n} of {total} unlocked.":"{total} 嘅 {n} 已經解鎖。","Unlocked {date}.":"解鎖咗 {date} 。","Loading boards…":"正在載入棋盤…","No entries yet — be the first.":"暫時未有紀錄 — 成為第一個吧。","Personal bests on this device:":"呢部裝置嘅個人最佳成績：","Boards unavailable right now. Personal bests:":"而家棋盤唔可用。個人最佳：","When":"時間","No local results yet.":"仲未有本地結果。","Local bests (casual)":"本地最佳（隨便）","Ember Dusk":"餘燼黃昏","Moonlit Forge":"月光鍛造廠","Verdant Atelier":"綠意盎然嘅工作室","Frostbound Loft":"霜凍頂樓","Royal Velvet":"皇家絲絨","None":"無","Sparks":"火花","Comet embers":"彗星餘燼","Standard":"標準","Brass":"黃銅","Filigree":"細丝","Apprentice":"學徒","Cascade Master":"瀑布大師","Swap & match":"交換同匹配","Swap two neighbouring jewels (drag, or tap one then the other). A swap only counts when it lines up three or more of a color. Keyboard: {keys} move the cursor, {confirm} selects.":"交換兩個鄰近嘅珠寶（拖曳，或者㩒一個然後㩒另一個）。交換只會喺排咗三種或以上嘅顏色嗰陣先計。鍵盤： {keys} 移動光標， ​​{confirm} 選擇。","Moves & goals":"動作同目標","Every accepted swap spends one move. Finish all goals before moves run out. Goals sit in the objective rail; the HUD shows moves and score.":"每一個接受嘅換股都要花一招。喺動作用完之前完成所有目標。目標喺目標軌道入面； HUD 會顯示動作同得分。","Rays (4 in a line)":"光線（一排4）","A line of four forges a ray. It fires when matched or struck and clears a whole row or column.":"四個連成一線會鑄造一道射線。佢喺配對或者被擊中時發射，清除成行或者成列。","Blooms (L or T)":" Bloom（L 或 T）","Matching around a corner grows a bloom, which clears a 3×3 patch when it fires.":"喺一個角落配對會生長出一朵花，當佢起火嗰陣，佢會清除一個3 × 3嘅斑塊。","Prisms (5 in a line)":"棱鏡（ 5 個一排）","Five in a line cut a prism. Swap it with a jewel to shatter every jewel of that color; swap it with another special for a bigger effect.":"五個一行切一個棱鏡。用珠寶換咗佢，將每隻嗰種顏色嘅珠寶打碎；用另一個特別嘅換佢嚟有更大嘅效果。","Ice":"冰","Frozen jewels cannot move but still match. Matching through ice cracks it; deep ice takes two hits.":"凍結嘅珠寶唔可以移動，但係仍然匹配。穿過冰塊配對會令佢裂開；深冰需要兩次命中。","Crates":"木箱","Crates hold no jewel and never move. Matches next to a crate dent it; banded crates take two hits.":"木箱入面冇寶石，永遠唔郁。喺木箱隔離做連線可以打凹佢；帶箍木箱要打兩下。","Stars & mastery":"星星同掌握","Finish goals for ★, beat score thresholds for ★★ and ★★★. Every round earns mastery XP toward cosmetic themes, trails, frames, and titles — looks only, never power.":"完成 ★ 嘅目標，超過 ★★ 同 ★★★ 嘅分數門檻。每一輪都可以賺取掌握 XP 去裝飾主題、蹤跡、框架同標題 — 只係外觀，而唔係力量。","Fair play":"公平遊戲","Scoring is deterministic: the same seed and the same moves always produce the same score. Daily seeds never change once published.":"得分係決定性嘅：同一個種子同同一個動作永遠都會產生相同嘅得分。每日嘅種子一旦發佈就永遠唔會改變。","[low buzz]":"［低嗡嗡聲］","[chime]":"［鐘聲］","[chime rising x{n}]":"[ 響起鐘聲 x{n} ]","[sparkle]":"［閃閃］","[big blast]":"[ 大爆炸 ]","[blast]":"［爆炸］","[ice crack]":"［冰裂］","[crate breaks]":"[ 板箱斷裂 ]","[swirl]":"［漩渦］","[warm bell]":"［暖鐘］","[win fanfare]":"[ 贏得聲勢 ]","[soft descending tone]":"[ 柔和降調 ]","[time warning]":"［時間警告］","Lesson 1 — First Swaps":"第一課 — 第一次換股","Swap two neighbouring jewels to line up three of a kind.":"交換兩個相鄰嘅珠寶，排成三隻同類。","This is your workbench. Jewels line up when three or more of a color touch in a row or column. Swap the marked ruby down into the gap — drag it, or tap one jewel and then its neighbour.":"呢個係你嘅工作台。當一排或者一欄有三種或以上嘅顏色接觸嗰陣，珠寶就會排成一排。將標記咗嘅紅寶石換落去個隙度 — 拖曳佢，或者撳一個珠寶，然後撳佢嘅鄰居。","A match of three! Matched jewels leave the board and new ones cascade in from above. Now make any legal swap of your own.":"三個配對！配對嘅寶石會離開棋盤，新嘅會從上面跌落嚟。而家做一個你嘅合法交換。","Well done. A swap only counts when it makes a line — a swap that matches nothing is refused and the jewels slide back.":"做得好。交換只會喺佢行一條線嗰陣先計 — 一個冇任何嘢匹配嘅交換就會被拒絕，而珠寶就會滑返轉頭。","Lesson 2 — Rays (lines of 4)":"第二課 — 光線（第4行）","Match four in a line to forge a ray.":"將四個排成一條線，就可以鍛造出一條光線。","Four in a line forge a RAY. Swap the marked topaz down to complete a line of four.":"一行四個可以鍛造出一條 RAY 。將標記咗嘅黃金換落去，完成一行四條。","You forged a ray! A ray fires when it is matched or struck, clearing its whole row or column. Rays carry a color and match like ordinary jewels. Make any swap to continue.":"你鍛造咗一條光線！當光線被匹配或者撞到嗰陣，佢就會發射，清除佢成行或者成欄。光線就好似普通珠寶噉帶有顏色同配搭。做任何交換先可以繼續。","Lesson 3 — Blooms (corners)":"第三課 — 花（角落）","Match an L or T shape to grow a bloom.":"匹配一個 L 或 T 形，以生長一朵花。","Matching around a corner — an L or a T — grows a BLOOM. Swap the marked sapphire left into the corner.":"喺一個角落配對 — 一個 L 或者一個 T — 會生長出一朵花。將左邊標記咗嘅藍寶石換入角落。","A bloom! When it fires it clears a 3×3 patch around itself. Make any swap to continue.":"開花！發射時清除周圍 3×3 區域。做任何交換繼續。","Lesson 4 — Prisms (lines of 5)":"第四課 — 棱鏡（第5行）","Match five in a line to cut a prism.":"將五個排成一條線，切一個棱鏡。","Five in a line cut a PRISM — the rarest jewel on the bench. Swap the marked emerald down to complete five.":"一行五個切出一個棱鏡 — 長凳上最罕有嘅珠寶。將標記咗嘅祖母綠換落去，完成五個。","A prism! Swap a prism with any neighbour to shatter every jewel of that color — or with another special for something spectacular. Make any swap to continue.":"一個棱鏡！將棱鏡同任何相鄰寶石交換嚟粉碎嗰種顏色嘅每粒寶石——或者同另一個特殊寶石交換嚟製造壯觀效果。做任何交換嚟繼續。","Lesson 5 — Ice":"第五課 — 冰","Frozen jewels cannot move. Match through them to crack the ice.":"凍結嘅珠寶唔可以移動。穿過佢哋去打破冰塊。","Jewels under ice are frozen — they cannot be swapped, but they still match. Swap the marked sapphire down so the line runs THROUGH the frozen jewel, cracking its ice.":"冰下嘅珠寶係凍咗嘅 — 佢哋唔可以換，但係佢哋仍然匹配。將標記咗嘅藍寶石換落去，等條線穿過凍咗嘅珠寶，令到佢嘅冰裂開。","Cracked! The ice broke and the jewel was collected. One more frozen jewel remains on the bench — play on and break it, or just finish the round.":"裂開咗！冰碎咗，寶石被收集咗。凳子上仲有一粒冰凍嘅寶石 — 繼續遊戲打破佢，或者就咁完成回合。","Lesson 6 — Crates":"第六課 — 箱子","Crates block cells. Matches beside them break them.":"木箱阻擋格子。喺佢哋旁邊配對可以打破佢哋。","Crates pin the board: they hold no jewel and never move. A match made NEXT to a crate dents it. Swap the marked emerald down — the line will smash both crates at once.":"木箱釘死咗個盤：入面冇寶石，永遠唔郁。喺木箱隔離做連線可以打凹佢。將標記咗嘅綠寶石向下換 — 條線會一次過打爛兩個木箱。","Both crates broke from one match! Tough crates take two hits. Make any swap to finish the lesson.":"兩個箱都係一次消除破咗！硬箱要兩下。做任何交換就完成教學。","First Light":"第一道曙光","Gather rubies and amber for the workshop lamps.":"為工作坊嘅燈收集紅寶石同琥珀。","Kindling":"點火","Amber and topaz for the kiln.":"琥珀同黃玉用嚟燒窯。","Sixth Shelf":"第六架","A sixth color joins the bench.":"第六種顏色加入咗板凳。","Triple Order":"三重秩序","Three commissions at once.":"一次過三個佣金。","Apprentice Trial":"學徒試煉","Mastery: prove the basics under a tighter move limit.":"掌握：喺更緊嘅動作限制下證明基本知識。","First Frost":"初霜","A cold snap froze six jewels. Match through them to crack the ice.":"寒潮凍住咗六粒寶石。隔住冰層配對嚟破冰。","Thin Ice":"薄冰","More frost, same patience.":"更多霜，同樣耐性。","Deep Freeze":"深層凍結","Double ice takes two hits each.":"雙冰各受兩下。","Frozen Cargo":"凍貨物","Free the amethyst shipment.":"釋放紫水晶貨件。","Glacier Trial":"冰川試驗","Mastery: heavy frost, full commission.":"精通：重霜，滿佣。","Packing Day":"包裝日","Crates block cells. Match beside them to break them.":"木箱阻擋格子。喺佢哋旁邊配對以打破佢哋。","Heavy Stock":"重股","More crates in the way.":"途中仲有更多箱。","Reinforced":"加強咗","Sturdy crates take two hits.":"堅固嘅箱子受到兩次打擊。","Warehouse Maze":"倉庫迷宮","Crates in a cut-corner hall.":"斜角廳入面嘅木箱。","Storekeeper Trial":"店員審判","Mastery: frost and freight together.":"精通：霜降同運。","Broken Bench":"破損長凳","Holes in the bench change how jewels fall.":"長凳入面嘅窿會改變珠寶落嚟嘅方式。","The Hollow":"空洞","A hole in the middle of everything.":"萬物中心嘅一個洞。","Cold Columns":"寒冷柱廊","Split columns, frozen stock.":"分割柱，凍結庫存。","Quota":"配額","The guild wants points, not pretty colors. Cascades and specials pay best.":"公會想要積分，唔係靚色。瀑布同特價價錢最好。","Comptroller Trial":"審計官試煉","Mastery: a high quota on a broken board.":"精通：爛板上嘅高配額。","Grand Bench":"大板凳","A wider workbench.":"一個更寬嘅工作台。","Seventh Color":"第七色","Opal joins the spectrum.":"蛋白石加入頻譜。","Opal Rush":"蛋白石衝刺","Opals scatter the eye.":"蛋白石將眼睛散射。","Frosted Gallery":"霜畫廊","A cold gallery of seven colors.":"一個冰冷嘅七彩畫廊。","Curator Trial":"策展人試煉","Mastery: quota and frost on the grand bench.":"精通：配額同霜喺大凳上。","Deep Cold":"深層嚴寒","The deep cold returns.":"深寒重來。","Ironbound":"鐵綁","Reinforced crates around the hollow.":"空心周圍嘅鋼筋箱。","Salt Cellar":"鹽窖","Crates and frost in the cellar.":"地下室嘅木箱同霜。","Night Audit":"夜間審計","Points and amethyst before dawn.":"黎明前嘅點數同紫水晶。","Warden Trial":"監獄長審判","Mastery: every blocker you know.":"掌握：你識嘅每個阻擋者。","Twin Furnaces":"雙爐","Two great orders, one bench.":"兩大單，一張板凳。","Frozen Vault":"冰凍金庫","A vault of seven-color frost.":"一個七色霜嘅金庫。","Crate District":"木箱區","A district of freight.":"一個貨運區。","High Quota":"高配額","The guild raises its sights.":"公會提高咗佢嘅目光。","Assayer Trial":"鑑定師試煉","Mastery: quota among reinforced stock.":"掌握：加強股中嘅配額。","Ember Wind":"灰燼風","A narrow waist concentrates the fall.":"一個狹窄嘅腰部集中跌落。","Moon Quota":"月亮配額","Tight moves over cut corners.":"緊嘅移動過切角。","Frozen Freight":"凍貨","The hardest storage room in the workshop.":"車房入面最硬嘅儲物室。","Penultimate Order":"倒數第二個命令","Three colors, seven hues, no excuses.":"三種顏色，七種色調，冇藉口。","Master of the Cascade":"瀑布大師","Final mastery: everything the workshop has taught you.":"最後掌握：工作坊教你嘅一切。","One shared board for every player today. Same seed, same rules.":"今日每個玩家都有一個共享板。同一個種子，同一個規則。","Easy":"簡單","Five colors, generous moves. Learn the rhythms.":"五色，出手大方。學習節奏。","Medium":"中等","Six colors and a few crates.":"六種顏色同幾個箱子。","Hard":"困難","Frost on a split-column board.":"分柱板上嘅霜。","Expert":"專家","Seven colors, a quota, and no room for waste.":"七種顏色，一個配額，又冇浪費空間。","Sprint":"衝刺","Ninety seconds. Unlimited swaps — how much can you score?":"九十秒。無限換股 — 你可以攞幾多分？","Eight Moves":"八招","Twelve emeralds in only eight swaps.":"十二隻祖母綠只需八次交換。","Ice Storm":"冰風暴","Crack sixteen sheets of ice before the moves run out.":"喺移動次數用完之前敲碎十六塊冰。","Crate Maze":"木箱迷宮","A maze of freight. Clear every crate.":"一個貨運迷宮。清走每個木箱。","Hourglass":"沙漏","A tight-waisted board and a quota.":"一個窄腰嘅棋盤同一個配額。","Seven Seas":"七海．","All seven colors, few moves, big order.":"全部七種顏色，步數有限，大訂單。","Master's Eye":"師父之眼","No hints. Trust your reading of the board.":"冇提示。相信你對板嘅閱讀。","Grand Trial":"大審判","Frost, freight, and a quota on the grand bench.":"霜，運費，同埋大長凳上面嘅配額。","Fixed ruleset, player-chosen seed. Reach {target} points in {moves} moves; every unused move banks +{bonus}.":"固定規則集，玩家選擇嘅種子。 {moves} 動作中達到 {target} 點；每個未用過嘅移動銀行 + {bonus} 。","First Setting":"第一次設定","Complete your first stage, any mode.":"完成你第一個關卡，任何模式。","Full Spectrum Lapidary":"全光譜寶石","Create a ray, a bloom, and a prism over your career.":"喺你嘅生涯入面整出光線、光暈同埋稜鏡。","Steady Hands":"穩定雙手","Win five rounds in a row, any mode.":"任何模式，連贏五局。","Complete the final Journey stage.":"完成最後一個旅程關卡。","Hundred Evenings":"一百個晚上","Complete one hundred rounds in total.":"總共完成一百個回合。","{hint} hint · {undo} undo (practice) · {skip} skip animation · {camera} camera · {mute} mute · {pause} pause. Gamepad: {a} select, {b} cancel, {x} hint, {y} undo, {start} pause. Rebind everything in the StarHermit Options.":"{hint} 提示 · {undo} 復原（練習） · {skip} 跳過動畫 · {camera} 相機 · {mute} 靜音 · {pause} 暫停。遊戲手柄： {a} 選擇， {b} 取消， {x} 提示， {y} 撤銷， {start} 暫停。重新綁定星隱士選項入面嘅所有內容。","row {r} column {c}":"第 {r} 行第 {c} 列","Volumes for music, effects and the interface, the voice limit and mute are in the StarHermit Options.":"音樂、效果同介面嘅音量、語音限制同靜音都喺星隱士選項入面。","Text size, high contrast, reduced motion and vibration are in the StarHermit Options.":"文字大小、高對比度、減少嘅動作同震動都喺星隱士選項入面。","Graphics quality, render scale and the frame-rate limit are in the StarHermit Options.":"圖像質素、渲染比例同埋帧速率限制都喺星隱士選項入面。","Keys and gamepad buttons are rebound in the StarHermit Options.":"按鍵與手掣按鈕可在 StarHermit 選項中重新綁定。","Progress reset.":"進度已重設。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Mute game sounds":"靜音遊戲聲","High score":"最高分","Graphics":"畫面","Change keys and buttons":"更改按鍵同按鈕"}
